	| Project         | KORONE                        |
	| Name            | Korone - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Product         | DXP Production 7.2            |
	| Type            | Production                    |
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Korone - ${staticProjectName}" for the product "DXP Production"

Scenario: Deactivate and activate license
	Testing the ability to generate a new license for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki and deactivating it before re activating it

